/* Compare tray (DESIGN.md, 2026-10-25): auto-pair diff of the two most
   recent completed trace runs, hop-aligned inside the log-card. Protocol
   strings are the verbatim journey-log frames in var(--mono) — the tray
   never mints hop text. Rows ellipsize on one line (full text rides the
